            "id": 2863353,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Right. I've now almost succeeded in finalizing plans for our tour, so I'll bring you up to date with what I know. As you know, we're flying first to Munich on Monday, the fourth. The flight is at 11:30, so it's too early to have lunch at the airport. I suggest we meet there for coffee at ten, which should give us plenty of time for breakfast before we leave home.",
